     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div>-- <br>You received this message because you are subscribed to the ggplot2 mailing list.<br>Please provide a reproducible example: <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792376191110000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0XZmWc7e49JWYITgaX5VaS\">https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility</a><br><br>To post: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>To unsubscribe: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a><br>More options: <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792376191110000&amp;usg=AOvVaw26QbgmlxG_aTmYbuUv-tTp\">http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2</a><br></div></blockquote></div><br></div></div>"
